{"id":"n15809-3-6","stage":2,"title":"순하다 · (口感、口味)柔和","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15809-3-6-1","ko":"카레는 순한 맛과 매운 맛이 있습니다. 어떤 것으로 드릴까요?","zh":"咖喱有原味和辣味，您要哪种？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카레는","meaning":"咖喱，咖喱粉","explanation":"카레：咖喱，咖喱粉；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"카레","audio":"/audio/304c5e2238b9a3bbfcd4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28147","senseId":"1","lemma":"카레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카레는","audio":"/audio/6dbc23db2bd93868628a.mp3"}},{"text":"순한","meaning":"(口感、口味)柔和，醇和","explanation":"순하다：(口感、口味)柔和，醇和；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"순하다","audio":"/audio/bb70e938bbf8b324f229.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15809","senseId":"3","lemma":"순하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"순한","audio":"/audio/287f8009892da4867b02.mp3"}},{"text":"맛과","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛과","audio":"/audio/3ec419b692ff935f0507.mp3"}},{"text":"매운","meaning":"辣","explanation":"맵다：辣；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맵다","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74131","senseId":"1","lemma":"맵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매운","audio":"/audio/e008a63b3263410b6f35.mp3"}},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"s